  "description": "The proposal involves the construction of a single-storey rear extension to provide an enlarged and improved living space. The extension will be built within the rear garden area and will remain subordinate in scale to the existing property. External materials, including brickwork, roof finish and fenestration, will match or closely complement the appearance of the existing dwelling to ensure visual continuity.\n\nAs part of the works, the internal chimney breasts are to be removed, and the internal layout will be reconfigured. This includes the relocation of the kitchen and the extension of the existing downstairs bathroom, all within the existing ground-floor footprint of the property. No changes are proposed to the front elevation or to the existing vehicular or pedestrian access.\n\nThe proposed development has been designed to enhance internal usability while maintaining the character of the property and preserving neighboring amenity.",
